 "summary": "This is a mutual NDA between Northwind Labs, Inc. and Bluepeak Systems LLC effective February 25, 2026, running 12 months with confidentiality obligations lasting 3 years after termination and governed by Florida law. It also contains a non-solicitation clause and an annual audit right, but has no liability cap, renewal terms, fees, or termination-for-convenience provision."
